WEBVTT

00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:15.370
Everyone, look!
He's coming out of his home!

00:00:15.370 --> 00:00:17.250
November 19th, 9:50 AM,

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:22.500
for the crime of violating the
demonite trading and exchange law,

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:25.590
Mr. Ninomiya has been placed
under arrest! He is under arrest!

00:00:28.510 --> 00:00:31.430
N-No way...

00:00:31.430 --> 00:00:35.680
Ninomiya... Ninomiya... got caught!

00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:42.020
THE DUNGEON OF BLACK COMPANY

00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:47.520
Episode 12

00:00:42.730 --> 00:00:48.150
You have reportedly suffered huge
financial losses because of Mr. Ninomiya.

00:00:48.150 --> 00:00:53.030
Do you believe all the
charges against him are true?

00:00:53.030 --> 00:00:55.240
We believe there is no room for doubt.

00:00:55.240 --> 00:00:57.830
The "Dungeon Black Company"
that he manages used illegal means

00:00:57.830 --> 00:01:04.330
to reach previously unexplored floors
in a dungeon owned by Raiza'ha.

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:08.170
There, he conducted illegal
demonite looting activities.

00:01:08.170 --> 00:01:11.380
In fact, even while he
was an employee of Raiza'ha,

00:01:11.380 --> 00:01:14.140
he used many unscrupulous means
to raise his performance metrics.

00:01:14.140 --> 00:01:17.510
Numerous victims have come forward.

00:01:20.100 --> 00:01:24.350
Mr. Ninomiya used a sleepwalker's
staff on us without a license.

00:01:24.350 --> 00:01:29.820
He forced us to work...
I still have nightmares about it.

00:01:29.820 --> 00:01:31.570
Me too!

00:01:31.570 --> 00:01:35.280
Ninomiya never gave back
the money I lent him!

00:01:35.280 --> 00:01:39.120
One time, he took me
to a dark alley, and...

00:01:39.120 --> 00:01:41.750
Oh, I can't say!

00:01:41.750 --> 00:01:46.630
It is truly regrettable that a person
who was once under our employ

00:01:46.630 --> 00:01:48.550
has become such a criminal.

00:01:48.550 --> 00:01:50.800
However, we would like to mention that

00:01:50.800 --> 00:01:55.220
we were able to find out
the truth about the evil Ninomiya,

00:01:55.220 --> 00:01:59.220
thanks to our company's
proud hero, Kinou Shia.

00:01:59.220 --> 00:02:03.480
I'd like to ask you to spearhead
our efforts to defeat Ninomiya.

00:02:03.480 --> 00:02:05.480
M-Me?!

00:02:05.480 --> 00:02:09.480
Every day, more and more employees
are forced to work in other dungeons

00:02:09.480 --> 00:02:13.780
because the Black Company
took their jobs away.

00:02:13.780 --> 00:02:18.990
A selfish dictator like him doesn't
understand the sorrow he's caused

00:02:18.990 --> 00:02:22.910
by destroying the everyday
lives of workers and their families.

00:02:22.910 --> 00:02:26.880
But you do, don't you?

00:02:40.220 --> 00:02:46.730
Ninomiya uses monsters for labor,
threatening the human job market.

00:02:46.730 --> 00:02:52.150
This is arguably the same as the
"Demon Lord" described in literature.

00:02:52.150 --> 00:02:56.200
Kinji Ninomiya is a threat to humanity.

00:03:06.370 --> 00:03:07.710
What was that?!

00:03:07.710 --> 00:03:09.960
Belza was totally serious!

00:03:09.960 --> 00:03:15.010
At this rate, they'll apply the
Threat to Humanity Law on Ninomiya.

00:03:15.010 --> 00:03:16.550
What's that?

00:03:16.550 --> 00:03:21.260
It's an outdated and
antiquated inquisition-style law...

00:03:21.260 --> 00:03:24.640
...that doesn't burden itself
with things like human rights.

00:03:24.640 --> 00:03:27.980
Unless we do something,
Ninomiya will be...

00:03:27.980 --> 00:03:30.060
Th-Then what...

00:03:30.060 --> 00:03:31.770
Mr. Wanibe.

00:03:31.770 --> 00:03:33.860
Oh, Queen Ant.

00:03:33.860 --> 00:03:35.860
I found it.

00:03:35.860 --> 00:03:37.400
Really?!

00:03:42.700 --> 00:03:48.160
You look good in the special suit that
cuts you off from outside magic power.

00:03:48.160 --> 00:03:54.090
Who would have thought you were making
demonite by feeding off of visitors.

00:03:54.090 --> 00:03:56.880
Additionally, you are accused of
using magic items without a license,

00:03:56.880 --> 00:04:01.390
causing property damage by
recklessly teleporting the Majin...

00:04:01.390 --> 00:04:03.890
You know what, Ninomiya?

00:04:03.890 --> 00:04:07.640
You're so, so very guilty!

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:11.020
I'm sure the truth
will come out very soon,

00:04:11.020 --> 00:04:14.770
but why don't you go ahead and confess?

00:04:14.770 --> 00:04:18.780
It might lighten your
punishment, somewhat.

00:04:19.740 --> 00:04:22.320
Hmm, silence, I see.

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:27.620
Stop trying to be slick!

00:04:27.620 --> 00:04:31.210
You see, I'm a special
threat investigator.

00:04:31.210 --> 00:04:37.050
In order to uncover the truth, I'm
permitted to use any means necessary.

00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:46.810
It's been a while since I've gotten
an assignment this fulfilling!

00:04:51.100 --> 00:04:54.110
Ms. Sari. How is he?

00:04:54.110 --> 00:04:57.480
There's no way he is still
maintaining his silence, is there?

00:04:57.480 --> 00:05:00.900
He's very resilient, definitely my type.

00:05:00.900 --> 00:05:03.990
I'd like to keep him
for as long as possible.

00:05:03.990 --> 00:05:09.750
I can't allow that.
That man inflicted pain on me.

00:05:09.750 --> 00:05:15.960
I need him to spend the rest of
his life crawling through trash heaps.

00:05:15.960 --> 00:05:18.050
Mr. Ninomiya?

00:05:18.050 --> 00:05:20.300
Shia...?

00:05:20.300 --> 00:05:23.430
One second, I'll use
healing magic on you...

00:05:23.430 --> 00:05:25.930
Idiot...

00:05:25.930 --> 00:05:30.640
That'll put suspicion on you, too...

00:05:34.020 --> 00:05:38.190
I'm sorry, this is my fault.

00:05:38.190 --> 00:05:40.860
Where did that come from?

00:05:40.860 --> 00:05:46.780
I wanted to make sure nobody had
to go through what I went through.

00:05:46.780 --> 00:05:51.200
As a hero, I just wanted to help everyone.

00:05:51.200 --> 00:05:52.290
But...

00:05:52.290 --> 00:05:56.670
The justice I sought was the
kind that hurt someone else.

00:05:56.670 --> 00:06:00.460
But still, I wanted
to fight for something...

00:06:03.010 --> 00:06:06.300
That's all right.

00:06:06.300 --> 00:06:08.260
You and I are different.

00:06:08.260 --> 00:06:12.060
If we both have things we can't
give up, sometimes we'll clash.

00:06:12.060 --> 00:06:18.190
But to me... the "weak people" that
you want to protect are poisonous.

00:06:18.190 --> 00:06:23.740
Defining others as weak gives me
the illusion that I'm better than them.

00:06:23.740 --> 00:06:26.910
And that will strip
my heart of the will to fight.

00:06:26.910 --> 00:06:31.950
I have to rise up to a height
where nobody can bind me.

00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:35.710
In order to do that, I can't
be satisfied with the status quo.

00:06:35.710 --> 00:06:37.750
There are enemies everywhere.

00:06:37.750 --> 00:06:40.210
A strong person is not
just someone with power.

00:06:40.210 --> 00:06:43.550
Those who know how to get
more power are the truly strong.

00:06:43.550 --> 00:06:46.680
They're the kinds of people
who are sharpening their skills

00:06:46.680 --> 00:06:49.350
while the weak struggle to catch up.

00:06:49.350 --> 00:06:54.770
To overturn that reality, I need
the will to keep pushing forward...

00:06:54.770 --> 00:06:56.440
A burning desire!

00:06:59.060 --> 00:07:03.900
True defeat is only
when my will is broken.

00:07:12.540 --> 00:07:14.540
Hello, Belza.

00:07:14.540 --> 00:07:16.920
Hello, Director Johari.

00:07:16.920 --> 00:07:19.580
You're pretty as always.

00:07:19.580 --> 00:07:24.260
Why don't you just quit your job
and become my secretary?

00:07:25.670 --> 00:07:27.470
Please, you cannot be serious.

00:07:27.470 --> 00:07:29.680
Are you getting drunk, my friends?!

00:07:29.680 --> 00:07:32.220
It's time to relax and party!

00:07:32.220 --> 00:07:35.230
Manager, you seem
to be having a good time.

00:07:35.230 --> 00:07:37.390
Oh no.

00:07:37.390 --> 00:07:39.480
Losers.

00:07:39.480 --> 00:07:45.400
Lacking flexibility and imagination,
like oily residue mucking up a floor.

00:07:45.400 --> 00:07:48.450
Just looking at them makes me sick.

00:07:48.450 --> 00:07:51.410
But all that is ending soon.

00:07:51.410 --> 00:07:54.200
The power of the dungeon ruins
that my grandfather mentioned...

00:07:54.200 --> 00:07:58.750
Once I take them back from Ninomiya,
everything will be solved.

00:08:03.670 --> 00:08:06.170
Emergency manual...

00:08:06.170 --> 00:08:09.550
I didn't know Ninomiya
made something like that.

00:08:09.550 --> 00:08:13.970
He did. I was in a panic
and forgot about it, but...

00:08:13.970 --> 00:08:17.180
...fortunately, the Queen Ant remembered.

00:08:17.180 --> 00:08:19.560
This is a real emergency.

00:08:19.560 --> 00:08:21.100
Yes.

00:08:21.100 --> 00:08:23.110
Sit tight, Ninomiya...

00:08:23.110 --> 00:08:25.860
We... won't...

00:08:25.860 --> 00:08:27.490
We won't lose!

00:08:27.980 --> 00:08:33.240
One Month Later

00:08:28.490 --> 00:08:33.580
The Raiza'ha Mining Corporation
shareholder meeting begins now.

00:08:33.580 --> 00:08:36.040
First, we begin with the selection process

00:08:36.040 --> 00:08:38.330
for the dungeon master
for the Guriano branch...

00:08:38.330 --> 00:08:45.050
I will trample over the flies infesting
this world and recreate it to my liking...

00:08:45.050 --> 00:08:49.840
To do that, I will first establish a firm
foothold in the corporate headquarters.

00:08:49.840 --> 00:08:52.590
There are no objections;
the motion is approved.

00:08:54.100 --> 00:08:58.890
I can't let these useless
extras drag me down.

00:08:58.890 --> 00:09:05.770
Next, the motion to promote Ms. Belza,
Dungeon Master of Detmolt, to director.

00:09:05.770 --> 00:09:07.860
If anyone has any opinions...

00:09:11.990 --> 00:09:16.490
This motion also passes without objection.

00:09:16.490 --> 00:09:18.950
Thank you all!

00:09:18.950 --> 00:09:23.330
Thank you; thank you very much!

00:09:23.330 --> 00:09:25.000
Everything is going smoothly...

00:09:25.000 --> 00:09:29.340
When the media started calling
that man's actions a revolution,

00:09:29.340 --> 00:09:32.380
I was a little worried.

00:09:32.380 --> 00:09:35.890
But now that I've come
this far, I can't lose.

00:09:35.890 --> 00:09:37.510
Total victory for--

00:09:37.510 --> 00:09:38.930
Next...

00:09:38.930 --> 00:09:40.350
Next?

00:09:40.350 --> 00:09:47.360
The motion to invite
Mr. Kinji Ninomiya as CEO.

00:09:48.360 --> 00:09:50.610
Huh?

00:09:50.610 --> 00:09:53.360
Ninomiya? Kinji?

00:09:53.360 --> 00:09:56.530
Why is his name being mentioned here?!

00:09:58.450 --> 00:10:01.370
What is going on?

00:10:01.370 --> 00:10:06.040
This is a joke... Who brought
this motion to the table?!

00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:07.170
We did.

00:10:11.970 --> 00:10:15.050
You...! Why are you here?!

00:10:15.050 --> 00:10:21.100
They suggested removing the current CEO
and putting Mr. Ninomiya in his place.

00:10:21.100 --> 00:10:24.480
What?! Under what authority?!

00:10:24.480 --> 00:10:31.150
It wasn't easy, even given
the Black Company's finances.

00:10:31.150 --> 00:10:34.740
We purchased 40% of Raiza'ha's stock

00:10:34.740 --> 00:10:39.330
and got letters of attorney from
15% of the current stockholders.

00:10:39.330 --> 00:10:44.620
Yup, yup! Cindy and I
worked really hard! Right?

00:10:44.620 --> 00:10:45.920
Yes.

00:10:45.920 --> 00:10:49.380
We got very close with the big boys.

00:10:45.920 --> 00:10:48.290
Mmm, delicious!

00:10:48.290 --> 00:10:49.380
Enjoy.

00:10:49.380 --> 00:10:56.590
It was scary, but we got
the big investors to like us.

00:10:56.590 --> 00:10:58.930
Thanks for your help!

00:11:01.310 --> 00:11:07.980
We needed to secretly collect
enough votes to win a majority,

00:11:07.980 --> 00:11:10.860
to make sure you didn't notice.

00:11:11.820 --> 00:11:16.110
Ninomiya is still under arrest
for looting and embezzlement!

00:11:16.110 --> 00:11:20.330
A criminal can't become CEO;
that's impossible!

00:11:20.330 --> 00:11:22.330
Not quite.

00:11:25.910 --> 00:11:27.460
Kinji Ninomiya...?!

00:11:29.290 --> 00:11:31.840
Hello there, Ms. Belza.

00:11:31.840 --> 00:11:34.380
Sari! You too?!

00:11:34.380 --> 00:11:39.340
Well, Ms. Shia turned this in.

00:11:39.340 --> 00:11:43.430
An official contract between
Raiza'ha and Mr. Ninomiya.

00:11:44.350 --> 00:11:46.600
Looting, embezzlement, other suspicions...

00:11:46.600 --> 00:11:52.820
All of the testimonies of several
of Raiza'ha's officers, right here.

00:11:52.820 --> 00:11:58.200
The demonite was not stolen. It was
already sold to Ninomiya beforehand.

00:11:58.200 --> 00:12:02.160
We also received numerous reports
and pleas from other sources.

00:12:02.160 --> 00:12:06.660
We had to accept the fact
that the arrest was a mistake.

00:12:06.660 --> 00:12:11.290
Ninomiya! Thanks for this.
It helped us pull this off!

00:12:12.750 --> 00:12:14.380
What is that...?

00:12:14.380 --> 00:12:18.800
Nothing much, just an emergency
manual for the Black Company.

00:12:18.800 --> 00:12:21.390
For a rainy day.

00:12:21.390 --> 00:12:25.890
It looks like he had
everything planned out.

00:12:27.100 --> 00:12:30.520
Wha... What...

00:12:30.520 --> 00:12:32.150
Well, anyway,

00:12:32.150 --> 00:12:36.030
Raiza'ha will operate under
my philosophy from now on.

00:12:36.030 --> 00:12:38.110
Thanks in advance for your help.

00:12:40.450 --> 00:12:45.410
What is going on?! Why do you
keep getting in my way...?!

00:12:45.410 --> 00:12:49.000
Everyone! He uses monsters
to threaten humanity!

00:12:49.000 --> 00:12:50.620
Are you going to let him get away with--

00:12:49.740 --> 00:12:51.870
Please stay calm, Lady Belza!

00:12:50.620 --> 00:12:55.170
Let me go! Don't touch me!

00:12:55.170 --> 00:13:00.880
No matter what others say, I am me,
nothing more, nothing less!

00:13:07.180 --> 00:13:09.100
Now that we have order...

00:13:09.100 --> 00:13:14.560
Mr. Wanibe's motion has already
received a majority of the votes.

00:13:14.560 --> 00:13:20.240
Mr. Kinji Ninomiya will
now serve as Raiza'ha's CEO.

00:13:20.240 --> 00:13:23.070
Now I win.

00:13:23.070 --> 00:13:24.870
Soon after...

00:13:24.870 --> 00:13:29.750
The Dungeon Black Company made
the Raiza'ha Mining Corporation

00:13:29.750 --> 00:13:32.960
a wholly owned subsidiary
and accelerated its growth.

00:13:36.090 --> 00:13:39.460
What a splendid view.

00:13:39.460 --> 00:13:42.930
Looking down on the populace is
a right reserved only for the victor...

00:13:42.930 --> 00:13:45.890
There! Enjoy this blessing of rain!

00:13:45.890 --> 00:13:49.180
Nobody dares oppose me now!

00:13:49.180 --> 00:13:53.900
I am god! I am the eternal victor!

00:13:57.520 --> 00:14:00.030
Ew, gross...

00:14:02.700 --> 00:14:08.990
I got what I wanted...
But what is this feeling?

00:14:10.870 --> 00:14:13.040
Hey, Belza.

00:14:13.040 --> 00:14:18.460
What is this? Do you think this
boring design will attract visitors?

00:14:18.460 --> 00:14:21.840
I... I'm sorry, President Ninomiya...

00:14:21.840 --> 00:14:24.550
Ranga! Your designs are no good either.

00:14:24.550 --> 00:14:26.850
What? Really?

00:14:26.850 --> 00:14:31.180
We'll have another competition in a week.
Get some new ideas by then!

00:14:31.180 --> 00:14:32.810
Yes.

00:14:36.440 --> 00:14:39.270
Sheesh.

00:14:39.270 --> 00:14:41.740
Wanibe, let's go for an inspection.

00:14:42.530 --> 00:14:45.110
You usually make all the
important decisions yourself.

00:14:45.110 --> 00:14:48.200
It's kind of rare for you
to let others handle things.

00:14:48.200 --> 00:14:52.330
This company can't grow
if it only relies on me forever.

00:14:52.330 --> 00:14:56.290
Besides, having those two compete
is good for their relationship, too.

00:14:57.290 --> 00:14:58.880
This also applies to you.

00:14:58.880 --> 00:15:03.630
One day, you'll have to fight
for something you can't give up.

00:15:03.630 --> 00:15:06.720
Make sure you build up
your strength for that day.

00:15:06.720 --> 00:15:08.090
What...

00:15:12.680 --> 00:15:15.440
Mr. Ninomiya is acting strange?

00:15:15.440 --> 00:15:17.900
He's always weird.

00:15:17.900 --> 00:15:23.030
No, I mean, it's a different
kind of weird from usual.

00:15:23.030 --> 00:15:27.160
Actually, Ninomiya said
something a while ago.

00:15:27.160 --> 00:15:29.700
I've really learned my lesson this time.

00:15:29.700 --> 00:15:32.620
I'm totally the outsider here!

00:15:32.620 --> 00:15:33.950
Outsider?

00:15:33.950 --> 00:15:38.380
Yeah! I'm not from this world.

00:15:40.920 --> 00:15:43.380
That's absurd, even for him...

00:15:43.380 --> 00:15:45.550
I know about that, too.

00:15:45.550 --> 00:15:49.300
Ninomiya is from a place called "Japan."

00:15:49.300 --> 00:15:54.100
In the future, there was an argument about
whether he should go back there or not.

00:15:54.100 --> 00:15:55.520
I knew it...

00:15:55.520 --> 00:16:00.060
But what does that have to do with
how Mr. Ninomiya is behaving now...?

00:16:00.060 --> 00:16:01.690
Could it be...?

00:16:01.690 --> 00:16:06.650
Yes. Ninomiya might be thinking about
leaving, using the power of the ruins.

00:16:06.650 --> 00:16:08.660
N-No!

00:16:10.200 --> 00:16:12.990
Hey, what are you guys doing?

00:16:14.240 --> 00:16:16.410
Don't slack off.

00:16:18.000 --> 00:16:19.750
N-Ninomiya!

00:16:19.750 --> 00:16:21.170
What's up?

00:16:22.670 --> 00:16:26.380
Are you thinking of going?

00:16:29.930 --> 00:16:32.100
When did you notice?

00:16:32.100 --> 00:16:33.850
No! Mr. Ninomiya!

00:16:33.850 --> 00:16:35.270
Are you really going?!

00:16:35.270 --> 00:16:36.770
Yeah.

00:16:36.770 --> 00:16:39.060
But why...

00:16:39.060 --> 00:16:41.940
I thought I was working hard to
make sure I never had to work again,

00:16:41.940 --> 00:16:48.360
but it turns out I feel most fulfilled
when chasing after a goal.

00:16:48.360 --> 00:16:52.740
I thought I should be more
honest with my feelings.

00:16:52.740 --> 00:16:57.950
I was able to see that because
of all the fun we had together.

00:16:57.950 --> 00:16:59.370
Thank you.

00:17:02.380 --> 00:17:06.050
I'll make sure I clean up
before I take off.

00:17:06.050 --> 00:17:08.510
So you all should get back to work, too.

00:17:08.510 --> 00:17:09.630
Later.

00:17:12.640 --> 00:17:14.970
So it's true...

00:17:14.970 --> 00:17:18.640
After all the messes he made...

00:17:18.640 --> 00:17:24.480
But he worked really hard in our world,
hiding his real desire to go home.

00:17:27.070 --> 00:17:29.610
Let's make sure we give
him a proper farewell.

00:17:29.610 --> 00:17:32.360
It's sad, but without that,

00:17:32.360 --> 00:17:37.790
neither we nor Ninomiya himself
would be able to move on.

00:18:00.810 --> 00:18:03.600
Wow, what's this?

00:18:04.350 --> 00:18:06.520
What kind of party is this?

00:18:06.520 --> 00:18:11.150
It's a surprise that we all set up
together, to send you off.

00:18:11.150 --> 00:18:14.160
I see, a farewell party.

00:18:14.160 --> 00:18:18.950
Ninomiya, we... we went
through a lot together, didn't we?

00:18:18.950 --> 00:18:21.500
Hmm? Yeah, sure.

00:18:21.500 --> 00:18:25.000
At first, I could barely keep up
with your crazy antics.

00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:30.130
I'll be honest, I was always either
angry at you or confused by you.

00:18:30.130 --> 00:18:32.420
But... watching you work so hard

00:18:32.420 --> 00:18:34.340
gave me a chance to rethink
how I was living my life,

00:18:34.340 --> 00:18:37.430
how I was just letting others run my life.

00:18:37.430 --> 00:18:41.180
I think I've become a bit stronger.

00:18:41.180 --> 00:18:44.980
At least strong enough
to take the first step...

00:18:44.980 --> 00:18:48.360
So I want you to do what you want
without worrying about me.

00:18:48.360 --> 00:18:49.440
Wanibe...

00:18:51.530 --> 00:18:55.950
I'm glad to have such a reliable ally.

00:18:55.950 --> 00:19:00.200
I'll leave the rest to you, Wanibe!

00:19:00.200 --> 00:19:03.040
Yes! You can count on me!

00:19:03.040 --> 00:19:07.540
Right then! In that case,
I'll go ahead and enjoy myself!

00:19:07.540 --> 00:19:09.960
I'll drink till I drop!

00:19:13.130 --> 00:19:14.590
Mr. Ninomiya, I--

00:19:14.590 --> 00:19:20.760
I need all the energy I can get to grow
the Dungeon Black Company even more!

00:19:20.760 --> 00:19:23.350
Right! Even more...

00:19:25.060 --> 00:19:28.900
Um, did I hear you right?

00:19:28.900 --> 00:19:30.690
What?

00:19:30.690 --> 00:19:33.900
You just said you'll grow
the company even bigger.

00:19:33.900 --> 00:19:39.910
Yes. Like I said the other day,
I feel most alive when chasing a goal.

00:19:39.910 --> 00:19:44.910
So now, I've decided to extend
my reach to the rest of this world!

00:19:44.910 --> 00:19:48.330
In order to do that, I'll travel
to the dungeons in other countries

00:19:48.330 --> 00:19:51.040
and gain even more power!

00:19:51.040 --> 00:19:53.630
Um... Just to make sure we're clear...

00:19:53.630 --> 00:19:58.090
You don't have any desire
to return to your original world?

00:19:58.090 --> 00:20:02.060
Huh? I worked so hard
to be successful here.

00:20:02.060 --> 00:20:04.720
Why would I give that up?

00:20:04.720 --> 00:20:06.690
How dumb is that?

00:20:06.690 --> 00:20:10.310
I think I made a mistake.

00:20:11.230 --> 00:20:13.360
Mr. Wanibe?

00:20:13.360 --> 00:20:18.490
Well, at any rate, I'll make you
all work until you drop!

00:20:27.540 --> 00:20:29.330
Be ready!

00:20:29.330 --> 00:20:31.080
Y-Yeah!

00:20:33.210 --> 00:20:39.130
Thirty jumbo pizzas, 50 boxes
of 3 kilo's of barbecue meat.

00:20:39.130 --> 00:20:41.550
Thank you.

00:20:41.550 --> 00:20:42.550
Here's the invoice.

00:20:42.550 --> 00:20:43.680
Yes.

00:20:45.810 --> 00:20:48.940
Ninomiya, pay this.

00:20:50.770 --> 00:20:53.150
What's with this amount?!

00:20:53.150 --> 00:20:55.860
So not enough.

00:20:55.860 --> 00:20:59.610
Understood. Let's order more.

00:20:59.610 --> 00:21:01.700
And more drinks, too.

00:21:01.700 --> 00:21:05.620
Hey! It's my send-off party;
why should I pay?!

00:21:05.620 --> 00:21:08.040
Just make the company pay for it.

00:21:08.040 --> 00:21:09.410
Yes.

00:21:09.410 --> 00:21:10.420
Hey!

00:21:11.880 --> 00:21:15.380
I'm just getting warmed up.
It's time to get serious.

00:21:15.380 --> 00:21:21.470
You weren't serious yet?!
You useless eater!

00:21:15.380 --> 00:21:21.470
Meat. Pizza. Meat. Pizza.

00:21:24.350 --> 00:21:26.060
Right!

00:21:26.060 --> 00:21:29.180
You all better stay sharp today too!

00:21:29.180 --> 00:21:30.310
Yeah!

00:21:30.310 --> 00:21:31.650
Right.

00:21:59.380 --> 00:22:02.510
There you are.

00:22:02.510 --> 00:22:04.050
Follow me.

00:22:04.050 --> 00:22:10.230
I'll show you how
I'll conquer this whole world!
